{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜天晴乾燥　市區最高氣溫約30度\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORCAST-261030-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。本港地區今日(10月30日)天氣預測，天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.241623+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:04:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:18:34.272721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:13.846176+00:00","content_hash":"3af777de4b618d5225643617b0c08b1b620728b878b49c9730bfd51f7ee23842","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}